  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Bonus Action, you can assume a magically majestic presence for 1 minute or until you have the &amp;Reference[Incapacitated] condition. For the duration, whenever any creature hits you with an attack roll for the first time on a turn, the attacker must succeed on a [[/save]]{Charisma saving throw} against your spell save DC, or the attack misses instead, as the creature recoils from your majesty.</p><p>Once you assume this majestic presence, you can't do so again until you finish a Short or Long Rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-NbhuxdzHOM4DrYtJ\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The <strong>Assume Majestic Presence</strong> activity includes an Active Effect for tracking your presence.</p><p>The <strong>Recoil Save</strong> activity includes the saving throw for the attacking creature.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
